{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before the introduction begins...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a heads-up \u2014 this is a story that takes time to get into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a lot going on in the story, with many characters appearing throughout, so the setup is quite long. It\u2019ll take about five hours before the plot truly starts to unfold. You\u2019ll need to get through a somewhat chaotic and dull first chapter, which lasts about an hour. Once you get used to that sense of confusion, the story will gradually become more and more engaging over the next dozen hours or so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story will feel confusing all the way until you reach the ending</strong> \u2014 and that\u2019s completely normal. That confusion will transform into a new and clear understanding once you reach the final destination. If you can stick through the first chapter and start to find the story interesting, then the ending is sure to surprise you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is around four hours long. If you\u2019re not totally uninterested after starting the game, please try to get through the first chapter. (Chapters aren\u2019t clearly marked in-game, but when you finish the first chapter, you\u2019ll definitely feel it. It takes a little over an hour.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the story is so confusing, it\u2019s hard to give a straightforward summary \u2014 so here\u2019s just a brief introduction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(No English Demo just yet &gt;_&lt;)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a sci-fi text game built around conversations.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll follow a group of researchers trying to survive on an alien planet. With your ability to move back and forth in time, you\u2019ll collect topics, trigger conversations, get to know different teammates, and try to stop them from falling into an unknown abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intertwined timelines, reversed causality... Why can you travel through time? And how will you use that to recover your lost past and save this cheerful yet secretly troubled group of companions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fishing, play cards, chat \u2014 and maybe save the world while you\u2019re at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954930/extras/fd9878916faec9a65f1fa04fb17826ab.poster.avif?t=1763643245\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954930/extras/fd9878916faec9a65f1fa04fb17826ab.webm?t=1763643245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954930/extras/fd9878916faec9a65f1fa04fb17826ab.mp4?t=1763643245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time-based narrative unlike anything else \u2014 or maybe it\u2019s not about time loops at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly a hundred characters (if you round up a little) with different ages, personalities, and backgrounds. (No romance routes.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new people and influence time and space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become friends with robots! Or even become a robot yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gossip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and card games. (<i>Note: Not available in the current demo.</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parrots, frogs, dogs, <span class=\"bb_strike\">cockroaches</span>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Debates about the soul and the universe.</span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 